  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>vorozole</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L02BG05</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>two compartments, IV dosing <small>(PK_2C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Piotrovsky VK et al. 1998</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>healthy volunteers and breast cancer patients</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>vorozole</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>accepted with caveats</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_vorozole/Vorozole_Piotrovsky1998_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL (patients)</td><td>4.8</td><td>l/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>Q (WT coefficient)</td><td>0.17</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>Q</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vc (WT coefficient)</td><td>0.43</td><td>l/kg</td><td><small>V1</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vp (women)</td><td>0.64</td><td>l/kg</td><td><small>V2</small></td></tr></table><h4>About vorozole</h4><p>Vorozole is an aromatase inhibitor studied as an anticancer (antineoplastic) agent. It remains experimental and does not appear to be an approved medicine on the market.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7941876\">Wikidata Q7941876</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Vorozole\">Vorozole</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Piotrovsky VK et al. (1998). Effects of demographic variables on vorozole pharmacokinetics in healthy volunteers and in breast cancer patients. <i>Cancer chemotherapy and pharmacology 42(3):221–228</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s002800050808\">10.1007/s002800050808</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/9685057\">9685057</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Piotrovsky_1998: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"),
